{"id":"07-vardcentralen","level":"A1","title":{"sv":"På vårdcentralen","en":"At the health centre","zh":"在社区医疗中心"},"scene":{"en":"Li has a sore throat and a fever and sees a nurse and a doctor.","zh":"Li 喉咙痛、发烧，先见护士再见医生。"},"vocab":[{"sv":"vårdcentral","en":"primary-care health centre","zh":"社区医疗中心（初级医疗）"},{"sv":"ha ont i","en":"to have pain in","zh":"……疼"},{"sv":"förkylning","en":"a cold","zh":"感冒"},{"sv":"värktablett","en":"painkiller","zh":"止痛片"},{"sv":"väntrum","en":"waiting room","zh":"候诊室"}],"lines":[{"who":"Sköterska","sv":"Hej, vad kan jag hjälpa dig med?","en":"Hi, what can I help you with?","zh":"你好，有什么可以帮你？","tokens":[{"t":"Hej","id":1162},{"t":", "},{"t":"vad","id":147},{"t":" "},{"t":"kan","id":100},{"t":" "},{"t":"jag","id":102},{"t":" "},{"t":"hjälpa","id":453},{"t":" "},{"t":"dig","id":134},{"t":" "},{"t":"med","id":104},{"t":"?"}],"audio":"audio/07-vardcentralen/01.mp3"},{"who":"Li","sv":"Hej. Jag har ont i halsen och jag har feber.","en":"Hi. I have a sore throat and a fever.","zh":"你好。我喉咙痛，还发烧。","tokens":[{"t":"Hej","id":1162},{"t":". "},{"t":"Jag","id":102},{"t":" "},{"t":"har","id":90},{"t":" "},{"t":"ont","id":806},{"t":" "},{"t":"i","id":89},{"t":" "},{"t":"halsen","id":2870},{"t":" "},{"t":"och","id":87},{"t":" "},{"t":"jag","id":102},{"t":" "},{"t":"har","id":90},{"t":" "},{"t":"feber","id":5195},{"t":"."}],"note":{"en":"Body pain: “Jag har ont i” + the definite form: halsen, huvudet, magen, ryggen.","zh":"身体疼痛：“Jag har ont i” + 定指形式：halsen（喉咙）、huvudet（头）、magen（肚子）、ryggen（背）。"},"audio":"audio/07-vardcentralen/02.mp3"},{"who":"Sköterska","sv":"Hur länge har du varit sjuk?","en":"How long have you been ill?","zh":"你病了多久了？","tokens":[{"t":"Hur","id":157},{"t":" "},{"t":"länge","id":252},{"t":" "},{"t":"har","id":90},{"t":" "},{"t":"du","id":134},{"t":" "},{"t":"varit","id":88},{"t":" "},{"t":"sjuk","id":867},{"t":"?"}],"audio":"audio/07-vardcentralen/03.mp3"},{"who":"Li","sv":"Sedan i måndags. Tre dagar.","en":"Since Monday. Three days.","zh":"从周一开始，三天了。","tokens":[{"t":"Sedan","id":185},{"t":" "},{"t":"i","id":89},{"t":" "},{"t":"måndags"},{"t":". "},{"t":"Tre","id":72},{"t":" "},{"t":"dagar","id":190},{"t":"."}],"note":{"en":"“I måndags” = last Monday (past); “på måndag” = next Monday.","zh":"“i måndags” = 上周一（过去）；“på måndag” = 下周一。"},"audio":"audio/07-vardcentralen/04.mp3"},{"who":"Sköterska","sv":"Har du hosta?","en":"Do you have a cough?","zh":"咳嗽吗？","tokens":[{"t":"Har","id":90},{"t":" "},{"t":"du","id":134},{"t":" "},{"t":"hosta","id":6957},{"t":"?"}],"audio":"audio/07-vardcentralen/05.mp3"},{"who":"Li","sv":"Ja, lite. Och jag är väldigt trött.","en":"Yes, a little. And I'm very tired.","zh":"有一点。而且我很累。","tokens":[{"t":"Ja","id":350},{"t":", "},{"t":"lite","id":172},{"t":". "},{"t":"Och","id":87},{"t":" "},{"t":"jag","id":102},{"t":" "},{"t":"är","id":88},{"t":" "},{"t":"väldigt","id":345},{"t":" "},{"t":"trött","id":1401},{"t":"."}],"audio":"audio/07-vardcentralen/06.mp3"},{"who":"Sköterska","sv":"Kan jag få se ditt kort?","en":"May I see your card?","zh":"能看一下你的卡吗？","tokens":[{"t":"Kan","id":100},{"t":" "},{"t":"jag","id":102},{"t":" "},{"t":"få","id":116},{"t":" "},{"t":"se","id":139},{"t":" "},{"t":"ditt","id":217},{"t":" "},{"t":"kort","id":517},{"t":"?"}],"note":{"en":"“Kan jag få …?” = may I have …? Very common polite request.","zh":"“Kan jag få …?” = 我可以要/看……吗？很常用的礼貌请求。"},"audio":"audio/07-vardcentralen/07.mp3"},{"who":"Li","sv":"Ja, varsågod.","en":"Yes, here you are.","zh":"好的，给你。","tokens":[{"t":"Ja","id":350},{"t":", "},{"t":"varsågod","id":90001},{"t":"."}],"audio":"audio/07-vardcentralen/08.mp3"},{"who":"Sköterska","sv":"Tack. Sätt dig i väntrummet, så ropar doktorn upp dig.","en":"Thanks. Take a seat in the waiting room and the doctor will call you.","zh":"谢谢。请在候诊室坐一下，医生会叫你。","tokens":[{"t":"Tack","id":903},{"t":". "},{"t":"Sätt","id":215},{"t":" "},{"t":"dig","id":134},{"t":" "},{"t":"i","id":89},{"t":" "},{"t":"väntrummet"},{"t":", "},{"t":"så","id":117},{"t":" "},{"t":"ropar","id":1936},{"t":" "},{"t":"doktorn","id":2091},{"t":" "},{"t":"upp","id":170},{"t":" "},{"t":"dig","id":134},{"t":"."}],"note":{"en":"“Sätt dig” = sit down (reflexive). “Så” here links two actions: do this, and then that happens.","zh":"“Sätt dig” = 坐下（反身动词）。这里的“så”连接两个动作：你这样做，然后会发生那个。"},"audio":"audio/07-vardcentralen/09.mp3"},{"who":"Läkare","sv":"Det är en vanlig förkylning. Vila och drick mycket vatten.","en":"It's a common cold. Rest and drink plenty of water.","zh":"是普通感冒。多休息，多喝水。","tokens":[{"t":"Det","id":92},{"t":" "},{"t":"är","id":88},{"t":" "},{"t":"en","id":93},{"t":" "},{"t":"vanlig","id":420},{"t":" "},{"t":"förkylning","id":6158,"v":"förkylning"},{"t":". "},{"t":"Vila","id":1985},{"t":" "},{"t":"och","id":87},{"t":" "},{"t":"drick","id":1280},{"t":" "},{"t":"mycket","id":128},{"t":" "},{"t":"vatten","id":633},{"t":"."}],"audio":"audio/07-vardcentralen/10.mp3"},{"who":"Li","sv":"Behöver jag medicin?","en":"Do I need medicine?","zh":"我需要吃药吗？","tokens":[{"t":"Behöver","id":204},{"t":" "},{"t":"jag","id":102},{"t":" "},{"t":"medicin","id":2000},{"t":"?"}],"audio":"audio/07-vardcentralen/11.mp3"},{"who":"Läkare","sv":"Nej, men du kan ta en värktablett om du behöver.","en":"No, but you can take a painkiller if you need to.","zh":"不需要，但需要的话可以吃一片止痛药。","tokens":[{"t":"Nej","id":456},{"t":", "},{"t":"men","id":113},{"t":" "},{"t":"du","id":134},{"t":" "},{"t":"kan","id":100},{"t":" "},{"t":"ta","id":137},{"t":" "},{"t":"en","id":93},{"t":" "},{"t":"värktablett","v":"värktablett"},{"t":" "},{"t":"om","id":111},{"t":" "},{"t":"du","id":134},{"t":" "},{"t":"behöver","id":204},{"t":"."}],"audio":"audio/07-vardcentralen/12.mp3"}],"series":"Basics"}